      "created_at": "2012-12-16T07:48:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't think Incindiary rounds change damage type, and so it would still be converted to toxic. If a card like Ra's Imbued Fire was played after a vat then its damage type conversion would happen after the vat.</p>",
